{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_kirara_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_kirara_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "隱藏結局",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_kirara_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6a4177f6534a960facc9b2f5aa65a9f35e7940198cf7f8cef36d1de7677f6642",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "宴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "赤冬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "我和雲母同學約好在這碰面的，她人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "什麼，你和那個來治病的同學也約在這裡了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "那個，嚮導？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（抬頭看了一眼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（舉起手機，對準公路上的風景）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（繼續在手機上敲擊）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "嚮導女士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（敲擊手機螢幕）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "為什麼把手機舉起來了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "“響......導......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "後面還跟著個問號？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你不是和我約好帶我出城的那個嚮導？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（敲擊手機螢幕）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "“不......是......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "那你為什麼要上我的車？難道你是龍門近衛局派來的 ？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（敲擊手機螢幕）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "別打字了，給我說話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "龍門......近衛局？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我以為......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "把話說清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我以為你是......接我去羅德島的司機先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "請問你們剛才在這見過一個拖著大箱子的少女嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "拖箱子的少女？沒見過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "你遲到了一個小時，剛剛才跑過來，你當然沒見過！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "小姑娘，你說的是一個拖著大行李箱的女孩子，看起來和你差不多大，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "沒錯沒錯！你看到她的時候，她是不是正在專心致志地拿著掌機打遊戲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "那倒不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "這話怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "她確實拿著個看起來像遊戲機的東西玩了一會，但很快就收回去了，之後就把手機掏了出來，一會打字一會照相的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "手機？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "（她自己的手機是從東國帶來的，在龍門能用嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "（沒時間管那麼多了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "應該就是她沒錯。您知道她去哪了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "剛剛一輛車停在她前面，她和司機對了個眼神，就拖著行李箱上車了。那個司機還幫她把行李搬進後備箱裡了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "那輛車往哪開了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "怎麼會這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "哪有這麼巧的事，約好給我帶路的嚮導也是東國裝束的阿戈爾年輕女性......怎麼偏偏就多了你這麼個礙事的出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "那個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "有話快說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我只是想問一下......為什麼......你覺得我穿的是東國裝束啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你穿得就像從東國的漫畫裡走出來的一樣，不是東國裝束是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我還以為只有穿得像個武將或者巫女一樣才算典型的東國裝束......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "武將？巫女？那不都是漫畫裡的東西嗎，東國真有這種人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "呃......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "你開這麼快......要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "去哪？我要回家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "可我和朋友約好了，她在剛剛我上車的那個地方等我......您能不能先把我送回去再回家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "想都別想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "或者......您的家在哪裡？您先回自己家，我再想法子讓朋友來接我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我家在敘拉古，這下你滿意了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "敘、敘、敘拉古？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "絕對不行！我一路從東國趕過來，可沒時間再去一趟敘拉古了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "看見這把刀了嗎，小姑娘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "難道你是......黑幫？敘拉古的黑幫？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "雖然不全是......但也差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "給我老實坐好，你現在是我的人質了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "可......你說了你沒接到嚮導，就算出了龍門也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "閉嘴！我沒有第二次機會了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "那個蠢賊不光搶了珠寶店，居然還劫持了人質......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "真抱歉，赤冬小姐。合作調查的請求是我們向羅德島方面提出的，結果出了這種事，讓您的朋友也牽連進來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "那些話以後再說！現在你們的處理措施是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "我們已經派人在高速公路和移動城市的各個出入口設卡盤查了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你怎麼不說話了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（舉起手中的掌機）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "都到了這個份上了，你還有心情打遊戲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "不可理喻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "怎麼了，遊戲不好玩了，又把手機拿起來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......這是我從東國帶來的手機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "所以？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "東國的手機在龍門是不能用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......給我看看你在寫什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "別廢話，把手機交給我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "絕對不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "拿過來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "*敘拉古粗口*，塞車？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "正好，小姑娘，這下我可騰出手來了，把手機給我看看。如果你沒在給人通風報信，我不會拿你怎麼樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我向你保證，我沒在做對你不利的事情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "保證有什麼用？如果保證有用，我會被人騙到這種地方來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "先把手機給我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我把手機闔上好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "不行——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "旁邊車裡的人已經在看我們了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "*敘拉古粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我不打字了，我把手機收起來，我接著打遊戲，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "從剛才開始就是，你隔幾分鐘就“啊”這麼一下，到底怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "這一關......我死了四五次了。我......靜不下心來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "嫌我礙事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "沒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（順手掏出手機）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你幹什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "對、對不起！我只是順手了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "等我回了敘拉古再放你走，到時候你想發簡訊發簡訊，想打遊戲打遊戲，沒人會管你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "你真的要回敘拉古？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我還能去哪？該死的親戚把我騙來了龍門，說這裡商機無窮......我呸！什麼商機！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "他其實是被人拖下了水，加入了黑幫家族，就想給自己也找個跑腿的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我捏著鼻子跟他幹了幾個月，實在受不了他們的這些齷齪事，剛一提要回家，他就搶了一家珠寶店，把罪名栽贓到我頭上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我才不想在異國他鄉被關個幾十年！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我的父親母親都在敘拉古，我出發前他們苦苦勸我，可我當時昏了頭，根本不聽他們的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我現在只想回家，只想見見他們！只要能見他們一面，我被人當成懦夫沉進河裡也值了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（習慣性地掏出手機，開始打字）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（小聲）其實......我也不想離開家啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（小聲）從我家那座移動城市到這裡，路上我也吃了不少苦頭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "可你現在根本沒有嚮導......你真的能回敘拉古嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "那你說怎麼辦？去找近衛局？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "就算是被騙的，我現在也是個黑幫分子。黑幫去和近衛局的人講道理，說“我是被人陷害的”？他們可能聽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "如果他們不想聽你說，你說再多話都沒有用，他們只會按照自己的想像曲解你說的話。我知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我還以為你會拼了命勸我去找近衛局的人“解釋情況”呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "但是，就算你不能說服他們，應該也不會死......如果是在荒野上出了什麼事，就真的再也回不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母＆陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "等等，那邊是——龍門近衛局的封鎖線？！他們在一輛輛排查？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "而且你居然又把手機拿出來了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你剛剛果然在給近衛局發消息！把手機給我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "休想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "雲母，趕緊下車，我們是羅德島的幹員，我們來接你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "該死的，近衛局的走狗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "雲母，抓住我的手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "怎麼了，為什麼不動？現在情況緊急，有什麼事情之後再說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "放心，雲母同學，你放在後備箱裡的收藏我已經拿到了，你趕快跟赤冬下車，那個劫匪交給近衛局對付！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "是宴？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "好、好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "（嘆息聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "雖然被他給跑了，不過還好，雲母同學沒事，雲母同學保護了一路的行李箱也沒事，可喜可賀，可喜可賀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "雲母同學，你在聽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "我知道你現在驚魂未定，不過一直在這裡站著，可是會堵塞交通的哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "啊！抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "果茶也喝了，享譽龍門的鱗丸也吃了，這下總該鎮定下來了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "嗯......嗯。謝謝你，宴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "我給你介紹一下，這位看起來像個武將一樣的人是羅德島的幹員赤冬，剛剛那個劫匪的車，本來應該是她去坐的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "她就是那個劫匪口中所謂的“嚮導”啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "那個人要找的......東國裝束的阿戈爾年輕女性......是她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "正是。龍門近衛局已經盯上了那個劫匪，又害怕打草驚蛇，才讓我假扮嚮導，伺機將其捉住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "誰知我疏忽大意了，還連累雲母你受驚，實在抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "沒......沒關......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（習慣性地掏手機）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（慌張地掏手機）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "用簡訊跟對面的人交流可不禮貌哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "不，不是......我的手機掉在那輛車上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "別擔心，一會我們一起去挑一個新的，就當是給你壓驚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "但是那個手機裡面有很重要的東西，真的很重要的東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "難道裡面記著什麼遊戲的秘技？還是說裡面有對戰高手的聯繫方式？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......雖然裡面確實都有，但不是那些事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "宴，我們能不能追上那輛車？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "赤冬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "追凶的事已經轉交給龍門近衛局辦了，我們再跟過去，只怕會給他們添亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "赤冬，雲母看起來可是真的著急了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "以我對她的瞭解，就算剛剛她的收藏都跟著那輛車跑得無影無蹤，她都不會這麼焦慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "你說是吧，雲母同學？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（重重點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "既然如此，我們跟近衛局打聲招呼也不是不行。但那個劫匪已經衝過關卡跑掉了，我們該去哪找他呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "這個——不用擔心，我有辦法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "好厲害，居然能在掌機上追蹤手機的相對位置？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "其實是出發之前，為了防止丟東西，我對各種電子設備都進行了一些改裝，裡面就包括互相定位的功能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "看不出來，雲母你改裝電子設備的功力又加深了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "總之，那個紅色的一直在移動的點就是手機所在的位置，看起來那個人還沒發現我的手機掉在了他的車上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "既然如此，事情就好辦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "宴，你這位同學的能力可不一般啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "那當然了，我的朋友個個身懷絕技，我最清楚啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "前方直行五百米後右轉下道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "從剛剛開始就是這樣，雲母一邊看掌機上的地圖一邊發出指令，就好像在打遊戲一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "沒有，不是這樣的，我只是......只是在看地圖而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "這種時候就別謙虛啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處傳來的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......負隅頑抗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處傳來的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......投降......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "錯不了，我們距離目標已經很近了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "不要再負隅頑抗了，放下武器，雙手抱頭，出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你們別——別過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "讓我離開，我要離開龍門，我要回敘拉古，我要回家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "別癡心妄想了！放下武器，你還能得到寬大處理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "沒門！我知道你們都想害我——我不會上當的！我一定能回家，只要從這裡出去，我就能回敘拉古了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "從那個親戚，到“家族”，到你們，再到剛剛那個小姑娘，沒有一個好人，沒有一個不在說謊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你們都給我消失！別來礙我的事！別想繼續騙我！我要回家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "不好，那個人好像已經失去理智了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "再這麼僵持下去，近衛局會下達強攻指令。一旦交起火來，雲母的手機恐怕保不住，那個人自己也凶多吉少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "赤冬，我們能不能偷偷溜進去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "絕對不行。闖進近衛局的警戒線裡，近衛局就不能保證我們的人身安全了，現在只能寄希望於那個人趕緊冷靜下來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "我問過近衛局，他搶劫珠寶店並未造成傷亡，對他的處理應該是監禁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "唉，監禁總比死掉好，他什麼時候才能明白過來呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "可他......說他自己是冤枉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "他在車上的時候跟我說的，他其實沒去搶那家珠寶店，他是被人陷害的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "他真說過這種話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "赤冬，麻煩你去把這件事告訴近衛局的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "我倒是沒問題，但近衛局的人可不會因為一個人的證言就放過他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "那也比現在這樣僵持著要好！快去吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "但願近衛局的人知道之後能改變一下策略。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "雲母同學，我們還是先離開這裡吧，如你所見，現在我們只能寄希望在別人身上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "最後重申一遍，放下武器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "如果你仍然不肯配合我們的執法，我們即將執行強攻指令！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "見鬼去吧！我明白了，你們從一開始就想把我騙到這種地方來要我的命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "我數到十，如果到時候你還不肯投降，我們即將進行強攻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "一......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "糟糕，赤冬恐怕趕不上了。雲母同學，你得做好心理準備......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "雲母同學？你在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雲母拿起掌機，手指在螢幕上飛舞起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "這是......越過了掌機的操作介面，正在自製的介面裡發送指令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "二......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "三......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "四......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "雲母同學，你在用掌機給自己打電話？你要和那個人聯繫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "只是......一些提醒而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "拜託了，拜託了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "九......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "十！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "即將下達強攻命令，各就各位——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_601_1",
      "text": "目標出現，沒有攜帶武器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_601_1",
      "text": "目標武裝已經解除......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "住院手續已經辦好了，雲母小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（敲擊手機螢幕）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "“謝謝”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "不客氣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "雲母同學，不是已經跟你說過了嗎，面對面還要打字交流，這也太不禮貌了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "抱......歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "唉，算了，你這性格也不是一天兩天養成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "走，我帶你去住的地方看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "那天真是千鈞一髮，我以為那個人死定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "事情告一段落之後，你受了那麼大的驚嚇，還去為他作證，也真是難為你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "所以，對他的判決下達了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "哪有這麼快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "不過，我聽赤冬說，近衛局查到最後，搶劫珠寶店的真凶的確不是他，他現在的罪名是妨礙公務和......和什麼來著，我記不清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "考慮到他加入黑幫也是受人蠱惑，可能關個一年半載就被驅逐出境了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "這可都是你的功勞啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我也只不過是讓他注意到了手機而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "他看了裡面的東西，知道我在車上的時候沒有騙他，也就僅此而已了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "真的嗎？所以你手機裡到底寫了什麼咒語，能讓那種窮凶極惡的傢伙放棄抵抗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "哪有什麼咒語，只是些再普通不過的東西罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "當然是了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "這麼普通，還不給我看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "是真的沒有看的必要，我說真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "那我就不逼問你啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "拜拜，雲母同學，如果累了就睡一覺吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "真的不是什麼咒語，只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "只是一些要謄下來寄出去的東西而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雲母掏出手機，在草稿箱裡一路上滑，一直滑到自己出發那天的日期。\n離開家鄉那座移動城市之後，手機的郵件功能就不能用了。\n但初次離家的少女仍然把路上的見聞和感想事無鉅細地記錄在了郵件的草稿箱裡。\n雲母從抽屜裡拿出一疊信紙，照著草稿箱裡面的文字，一字一句地謄抄起來。\n草稿箱裡既有大段的文字，也有凌亂的隻言片語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雲母忘我地抄寫著，寫滿了一張又一張信紙，直到日期上最晚的那一篇草稿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "草稿到此戛然而止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雲母撕下寫著這份草稿的信紙，把紙揉成一團，扔到地上。\n她把手機螢幕關掉，在新的信紙上重新寫下了“第三十四天”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
